# Alembic migrations

## Rules

1. **Alembic only** — no raw SQL migration files outside `apps/api/migrations/versions/`.
2. **Never edit a shipped migration** — files already in git history are immutable. Add a new revision.
3. Hook enforcement: `guard-shipped-migrations.sh` blocks edits to existing files under `versions/`.

## Workflow

```bash
pnpm run db:migrate:new   # autogenerate — always review diff
pnpm run db:migrate       # local upgrade head
```

## Autogenerate review checklist

- [ ] `clinic_id` on every clinic-scoped table
- [ ] Indexes on FK columns used in list queries
- [ ] `btree_gist` extension before exclusion constraints
- [ ] No accidental drops of prod columns without explicit plan
- [ ] Downgrade path sane (or document one-way migration)

Skill: `.agent/skills/alembic-migrations/SKILL.md`, `.agent/skills/fix-migration-issues/SKILL.md`.
